{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-q3eg-d5xt-y2rw-mkog","published":"2026-11-23T16:47:38Z","modified":"2026-11-25T00:00:10.801552499Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-42403"],"summary":"Apache Neethi does not properly detect circular references in policy definitions. When a WS-Policy document contains…","details":"Apache Neethi does not properly detect circular references in policy definitions. When a WS-Policy document contains circular policy references (where Policy A references Policy B which references Policy A), the policy normalization process can enter an infinite loop or cause excessive recursion, leading to a stack overflow or application hang. An attacker can craft malicious policy documents with circular references to cause a Denial of Service condition\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 3.2.2, which fixes this issue.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"open-liberty","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.23","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/open-liberty"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"26.0.0.11-r0"}]}],"versions":["26.0.0.11-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-q3eg-d5xt-y2rw-mkog.json"}},{"package":{"name":"open-liberty","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.24","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/open-liberty"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"26.0.0.11-r0"}]}],"versions":["26.0.0.11-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-q3eg-d5xt-y2rw-mkog.json"}},{"package":{"name":"open-liberty","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Debian:13","purl":"pkg:deb/dhi/open-liberty"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"26.0.0.11-0"}]}],"versions":["26.0.0.11-0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-q3eg-d5xt-y2rw-mkog.json"}}],"references":[